{"id":"n22109-17-5","stage":0,"title":"올리다 · 上交","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22109-17-5-1","ko":"김 대리, 아까 그 서류는 어떻게 했나?","zh":"金代理，刚才那份文件处理得怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）。","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"대리,","meaning":"代理（公司职级）","explanation":"대리：韩国企业中一般职员与课长之间的职级；这里是对金姓职员的称呼。","readings":[{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48362","senseId":"2","lemma":"대리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대리","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3"}},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"서류는","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서류는","audio":"/audio/81c9f807687ff6d9d222.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"했나?","meaning":"处理了吗","explanation":"하다：处理；-었- 表示已发生，-나? 是上级对下级的非敬语疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했나","audio":"/audio/19183aa84a54a8200246.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4e96b696526850f7","term":"대리","zh":"代理（韩国企业职级）","audio":"/audio/4e96b696526850f76e08.mp3","entryId":"48362","definition":"韩国企业中一般职员与课长之间的职级；这里称呼金代理。","pronunciation":["대ː리"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5b1b7328e58450cf1fc3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n22109-17-5-2","ko":"부장님께 올렸습니다.","zh":"我已经交给部长了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부장님께","meaning":"向部长","explanation":"부장：部门负责人；-님 是敬称，-께 表示向尊敬的人提交。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부장님께","audio":"/audio/6b630fab8d39a72c54b1.mp3"}},{"text":"올렸습니다.","meaning":"已经上交了","explanation":"올리다：向上级呈交文件；-었- 表示完成，-습니다 是正式礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"올리다","audio":"/audio/ff5095d829513a79ee33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"e